{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28884","headline":"陪越中使院诸公镜波馆饯明台裴郑二使君 · 许浑","name":"陪越中使院诸公镜波馆饯明台裴郑二使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倾幕来华馆，淹留二使君。\n舞移清夜月，歌断碧空云。\n海郡楼台接，江船劒戟分。\n明时自骞翥，无复叹离羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}